srow(305, 4, 'MATERIAL', f'IN ONE YEAR THREE RIGHTEOUS DIED — MOSES, AARON AND MIRIAM — AND ISRAEL FOUND NO REST AFTER MOSES ("I CUT OFF THE THREE SHEPHERDS IN ONE MONTH", Zechariah 11:8 — IN ONE MONTH? IN ONE YEAR): MIRIAM DIED — THE WELL CEASED AND RETURNED BY THE MERIT OF MOSES AND AARON; AARON DIED — THE PILLAR OF CLOUD CEASED AND BOTH RETURNED BY MOSES\' MERIT; MOSES DIED — ALL THREE CEASED AND DID NOT RETURN. AT THAT HOUR ISRAEL, SCATTERED AND BARE OF ALL COMMANDMENTS, GATHERED TO MOSES: WHERE IS AARON YOUR BROTHER? GOD HAS HIDDEN HIM FOR THE LIFE OF THE WORLD TO COME — THEY DID NOT BELIEVE HIM (WE KNOW YOU ARE HARSH; DID HE SAY A WRONG WORD AND YOU SENTENCED HIM TO DEATH?); THE HOLY ONE BROUGHT AARON\'S BIER AND HUNG IT IN THE HEAVEN OF HEAVENS AND STOOD IN EULOGY OVER HIM, THE MINISTERING ANGELS ANSWERING: "THE LAW OF TRUTH WAS IN HIS MOUTH AND NO INJUSTICE WAS FOUND ON HIS LIPS" (Malachi 2:6). ({SP_(305, 4, "בשנה", "אחת", "מתו", "שלשה", "צדיקים")} "in one year three righteous died"; {SP_(305, 4, "מתה", "מרים", "בטלה", "הבאר")} "Miriam died, the well ceased"; {SP_(305, 4, "בטל", "עמוד", "ענן")} "the pillar of cloud ceased"; {SP_(305, 4, "בטלו", "שלשתם", "ולא", "חזרו")} "all three ceased and did not return"): THE THREE GIFTS AND THEIR THREE MERITS — the well, the cloud (and the manna by the count of three) as ledger STATUSES tied to persons: the compile\'s daemon shape — a gift persists while its merit lives, the death event withdraws it (the Tosefta Sotah 11 the translator\'s parallel — the testing shelf). THE TWO FILES DIVERGE AT THE PROOF TEXT: the Hebrew cites Psalms 47:10 (the nobles of the peoples gathered), the English Numbers 21:18 (the well the princes dug) — read at the print, the Hebrew the ruling text. The Prophets\' seats cited (Zechariah 11:8, Malachi 2:6), never read. Fresh.')
